    {
      "id": "a-place-on-the-manifest",
      "title": "A name on the manifest",
      "text": "A merchant needs someone to copy cargo records aboard a ship leaving Alexandria. You know your letters, and the harbor suddenly feels like a doorway. At home, there is steady work. Across the city, a scholar's workshop has offered you a place. Which life will you begin?",
